      "note": "Decisions: Q1 OTEL-native/supplant (keep typed internal pipeline) + reconstruction invariant; two-layer field-naming (conform envelope, own harness.* + schema_url); Q2 logs+metrics; Q3 hand-roll+3-way conformance. Full event→OTLP map, rollup→metrics map, 33-file test index, Phase-0 backpressure sensors on 037 fixtures. Contract Ready.",
